        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 1453, 3\" Floor Mount Door Bumper with Hook</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 3 inch high floor mounted door stop with hold open hook is made of solid brass by Don-Jo. This medium size floor mount door stop is typically used in residential and medium duty commercial applications. Packaged complete with all installation hardware for wood and cement floors including a 5/16\" diameter heavy duty anchor for solid mounting.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DON-JO-1453_size.gif?v=1704354745\" width=\"600\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 1453 door stop size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo 1453 Hook Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Base Length: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Base Width: 1-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Height to Center of Rubber Bumper: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Bumper Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/1453.pdf?v=1704262351\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 1453 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
