                "description": "3 Inch Hook Door Stop, Don-Jo 1453 The 3 inch high floor mounted door stop with hold open hook is made of solid brass by Don-Jo. This medium size floor mount door stop is typically used in residential and medium duty commercial applications. Packaged complete with all installation hardware including a heavy duty floor anchor for solid mounting.",
